\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For the manuscript smooth three-dimensional CKS hyperboloidal exterior class with DEC, future-timelike Bondi energy-momentum, weakly future-trapped possibly disconnected boundary and positive full minimum enclosing area, is $\operatorname{sqrt}(E_B^2-|P_B|^2)\geq \operatorname{sqrt}(A_min/(16\pi ))$? Require sharpness from horizon-regular Schwarzschild hyperboloidal exteriors.

